# Release artifacts. These must not be tracked: the package-release workflow
# globs *.deb/*.rpm from the checkout, so a committed package gets attached to
# every future release (v1.2.0 initially shipped the stale v1.0.1 binaries this
# way). Released packages live on the GitHub release pages.
*.deb
*.rpm
checksums.sha256
